{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53743","headline":"逢友人 · 贾岛","name":"逢友人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"还似不才命未通，相逢云水思无穷。\n清时年少爲幽客，寒月更深听过鸿。\n东越山多连楚叠，南朝城古枕江空。\n苍崖欲隐谁招我？姜子生涯只此中。\n（见《吟窗杂录》卷十三梅尧臣《续金针诗格》引）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贾岛","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53743.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53743","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}